{"translation":{"id":"kan_okcv","name":"Biblica® ಉಚಿತ ಕನ್ನಡ ಸಮಕಾಲಿಕ ಭಾಷಾಂತರ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanokcv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"OKCV","englishName":"Kanada Open Contemporary Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"579eda1a2f0787e978bfdd1e238e1f22be5be659c98add6930ad2d796778f705","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31090,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_okcv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8fda6557d2590d4e512d2801111ece4ef0438ce426c3b9b41fc862a02e5e2271","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":125,"content":[{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಯಾತ್ರಾ ಗೀತೆ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರಲ್ಲಿ ಭರವಸವಿಡುವವರು ಚೀಯೋನ್ ಪರ್ವತದ ಹಾಗಿದ್ದಾರೆ;","poem":1},{"text":"ಆ ಪರ್ವತವು ಯುಗಯುಗಕ್ಕೂ ಕದಲದೆ ಇರುವುದು.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆರೂಸಲೇಮಿನ ಸುತ್ತಲೂ ಬೆಟ್ಟಗಳಿರುವಂತೆ,","poem":1},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರು ಈಗಿನಿಂದ ಯುಗಯುಗಕ್ಕೂ","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ತಮ್ಮ ಜನರ ಸುತ್ತಲೂ ಇದ್ದಾರೆ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ನೀತಿವಂತರು ತಮ್ಮ ಕೈಗಳನ್ನು","poem":1},{"text":"ಅನ್ಯಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಚಾಚದ ಹಾಗೆ,","poem":2},{"text":"ದುಷ್ಟನ ಕೋಲು ನೀತಿವಂತರ","poem":1},{"text":"ಸ್ವಾಸ್ತ್ಯದ ಮೇಲೆ ನೆಲೆಯಾಗಿರುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರೇ, ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವರಿಗೂ,","poem":1},{"text":"ಯಥಾರ್ಥ ಹೃದಯವುಳ್ಳವರಿಗೂ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದನ್ನು ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ಆದರೆ ಡೊಂಕು ಮಾರ್ಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ತಿರುಗುವವರನ್ನು,","poem":1},{"text":"ದುಷ್ಟರ ಸಂಗಡ ದೇವರು ತೊಲಗಿಸಲಿ.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲರ ಮೇಲೆ ಸಮಾಧಾನವಿರಲಿ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/125.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/126.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_okcv/PSA/124.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}